  "stage": "challenge",
  "difficulty": "advanced",
  "title": {
    "zh": "冷库分流队列",
    "en": "Cold-Room Dispatch"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "取件顺序与发货顺序",
    "en": "Pickup order and priority dispatch"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐四件并到出口。入库单依次列出 ice、foam、seal、vent。cold 字典为 1 的件优先出库，为 0 的件随后出库。同类保留入库单顺序，每个提交的件名都须从队头取出。 限 40 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Collect all four parts and reach the exit. The intake manifest lists ice, foam, seal and vent in order. Dispatch cold=1 items first and cold=0 items second, preserving manifest order within each group. Each submitted item ID must come from the front of a queue. Avoid patrols within 40 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
